{"id":286,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"The seeds ringing Breloom’s tail are made of hardened toxic spores. It is horrible to eat the seeds. Just taking a bite of this Pokémon’s seed will cause your stomach to rumble."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Breloom closes in on its foe with light and sprightly footwork, then throws punches with its stretchy arms. This Pokémon’s fighting technique puts boxers to shame."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It scatters poisonous spores and throws powerful punches while its foe is hampered by inhaled spores."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"The seeds on its tail are made of toxic spores. It knocks out foes with quick, virtually invisible punches."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It scatters spores from holes in the cap on its head. It loves warm and humid climates. It feeds on trees and plants in fields and forests."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Effect Spore","hidden":false,"description":"Contact with the Pokémon may inflict poison, sleep, or paralysis on the attacker."},{"name":"Poison Heal","hidden":false,"description":"If poisoned, the Pokémon has its HP restored instead of taking damage."},{"name":"Technician","hidden":true,"description":"Powers up weak moves so the Pokémon can deal more damage with them."}],"eggGroups":["Fairy","Grass"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fluctuating","habitat":"forest","color":"Green","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":285,"name":"Shroomish","condition":null,"children":[{"id":286,"name":"Breloom","condition":"Lv. 23","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,183],[1,33],[1,71],[1,73],[1,74],[1,77],[1,78],[1,92],[12,72],[15,29],[19,364],[22,68],[28,395],[33,388],[39,280],[44,402],[50,223],[55,264]],"machine